msgid ""
"<qt><p><b>Automatically unset fuzzy status</b></p>\n"
"<p>If this is activated and you are editing a fuzzy entry, the fuzzy status "
"is automatically\n"
"unset (this means the string <i>, fuzzy</i>\n"
